# Negative controls for the input step (plan 05-01, D-02, D-03): one per defect shape. The positive control is the toy
# literal of controls/_good/tree (two rows, the real grammar); each overlay replaces data/input/toy.literal.txt.
# Plan 05-05 adds the three profile cross-check controls: each overlay replaces the toy profile (two input.control.*
# fields: a mask that differs from the literal, a control without its field, a value that is not one key lines).
input-literal-name-set-missing
input-literal-duplicate
input-tag-missing
input-source-unknown
input-byte-mismatch
input-tiling-pins
input-profile-mask-mismatch
input-profile-field-missing
input-profile-field-shape
